  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DEC Phase 1: Turkey-Syria Earthquake Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed humanitarian response aims to provide immediate lifesaving support to highly vulnerable older people, older people&#x2019;s families, and persons with disabilities of all ages. This will be achieved through the following three outcomes: 
Outcome A - Given the nature of the disaster it is apparent that the basic needs of safe shelter, ready-to-eat food, clean water through water trucking and Non-food Items, especially hygiene items are priorities. Providing these basic items will be the base on which we build other services. 
Outcome B - linking mobile health clinics, Community Health Workers (CHWs) with Home Based Care for older women and men, especially older women and men with disabilities 
Outcome C- To invest resources in building knowledge and capacity in coordination mechanisms on the issue of ageing.</narrative>
  </description>
